questions.explanation:
**Given:**

480 &divide; {12 + 2 × (4 &minus; 9)}

**Formula used:**

BODMAS Rule

**Calculation:**

&rArr; 480 &divide; {12 + 2 × (4 &minus; 9)}

&rArr; 480 &divide; {12 + 2 × (&minus;5)}

&rArr; 480 &divide; {12 &minus; 10}

&rArr; 480 &divide; 2

&rArr; 240

**&there4; The correct answer is 240.**

